        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style=\"container-type:inline-size;position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background:#080e28;color:#edf4ff;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif;box-sizing:border-box\">\n<div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 44%,rgba(45,34,105,.26),transparent 65%),linear-gradient(rgba(111,128,219,.075) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(111,128,219,.075) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:auto,3.8cqw 3.8cqw,3.8cqw 3.8cqw\"></div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;right:0;height:.6cqw;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#5ce1ef,#966bf5,#df7cfa)\"></div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;left:4cqw;right:4cqw;top:3cqw;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\"><div style=\"font-size:1.3cqw;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.3em;color:#8ee7ed\">TWILITE <span style=\"color:#a6a7d9\">/ LEARNING LABORATORY</span></div><div style=\"font-size:1.25cqw;letter-spacing:.2em;color:#c6b4f8;border:1px solid #6858a9;border-radius:30px;padding:.55cqw 1.6cqw\">STUDY GUIDE · 09 CONCEPTS</div></div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;left:4cqw;top:8cqw;right:4cqw\"><div style=\"font-size:1.2cqw;color:#8bd8e8;letter-spacing:.26em;font-weight:800;margin-bottom:1.3cqw\">STRUCTURE · SPACE · MEANING</div><div style=\"font:700 5.3cqw/1.08 Georgia,Palatino,serif;letter-spacing:-.04em;color:#f6f4ff\">Graph-Based <span style=\"color:#81e7ef\">Interfaces</span></div><div style=\"font-size:1.65cqw;line-height:1.5;color:#c2cee7;margin-top:1.4cqw;max-width:67cqw\">Explore how connections become interfaces: from nodes and edges to semantic zoom, living views, and AI-native authoring.</div></div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;left:4cqw;right:4cqw;bottom:3.8cqw;padding-top:1.7cqw;border-top:1px solid rgba(147,140,215,.5);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:4cqw\"><div><div style=\"font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.2em;font-size:1.25cqw;color:#8be4e8\">FOLLOW THE CONNECTIONS</div><div style=\"font-size:1.42cqw;color:#bdcce8;margin-top:.75cqw\">Start at the topic · Follow prerequisites · Explore each concept</div></div><div style=\"text-align:right\"><div style=\"font:700 2.2cqw/1.2 Georgia,serif;color:#eee8ff\">Knowledge has a shape.</div><div style=\"font-size:1.15cqw;letter-spacing:.15em;color:#a8a5d5;margin-top:.5cqw\">AN EXPLORABLE STUDY GRAPH</div></div></div>\n</div>"
        },
        "memo": "The environment: the room the graph's work sits in. This poster teaches; delete it and the graph stands on plain graph paper."
      }
