        "title": "Graph layout and spatial organization",
        "classRef": "tlz://twilite.zone/library/classes/nodes/learn-a-topic/concept.node-class.node",
        "body": "A graph's logical structure does not prescribe its visual arrangement. Layout algorithms position nodes and route connections to reveal relationships. Spatial organization affects readability, navigation, and the user's ability to understand complex structures.",
